{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>現代人忙碌的生活節奏，經常讓我們忘了補充最基本的水分，導致疲勞、注意力下降甚至健康問題。《Stay Hydrated Pro》正是你隨身的飲水助手，透過智能提醒與簡單記錄，讓你不知不覺養成規律喝水的習慣。這款原價 US $1.99 的實用工具，今天限時免費中，無論你是經常久坐的上班族、運動愛好者，還是想關心長輩飲水狀況的家庭照護者，都值得立即下載。</p>\n\n<h2>智能提醒與個人化目標</h2>\n<p>根據你的年齡、體重與生活型態自動計算每日飲水量，並在你忙碌時推送溫柔的提醒通知。點按一次即可記錄一杯水，精美的進度視覺化讓你直觀看到補水狀況，還能查看每日、每週與每月的飲水趨勢，輕鬆掌握自己的健康節奏。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-6-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-7-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-8-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-9-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-10-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://static.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/1242x2688bb-11-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Stay Hydrated Pro</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-06-03T15:59:18.040496+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":348,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"unknown"}}